message: >-
  If you use this WebGIS or its dataset, please cite this release and retain
  attribution for incorporated Pleiades data.
title: "Ancient Greek World Atlas"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-15
authors:
  - family-names: Liaskos
    given-names: Alexandros
repository-code: "https://github.com/AlexandrosLiaskos/ancient-greek-world-atlas"
