license: MIT
keywords:
  - ancient Greek world
  - WebGIS
  - historical GIS
  - gazetteer
  - archaeology
  - linked open data
abstract: >-
  A Greek-first bilingual static WebGIS and reproducible scholarly dataset of
  226 settlements, sanctuaries and polities associated with the ancient Greek
  world. Version 1.0.0 includes reviewed chronology and point geometry, typed
  relationships, claim-scoped citations and external gazetteer alignments.
